@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
    <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> October 27, 2025</p>

    <p>
      At <strong>FightStats</strong>, we value your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use,
      and protect information when you visit our website, which provides statistics, event details,
      images, and news about UFC fighters and matches.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We may collect the following information:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Basic analytics data such as page views and browser type</li>
      <li>Information you provide when contacting us (e.g., name and email)</li>
      <li>Cookies to improve site performance and user experience</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>Your information is used to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Improve website performance and user experience</li>
      <li>Respond to inquiries or feedback</li>
      <li>Display relevant statistics, images, and event updates</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>
      Our website may include embedded media (e.g., fighter images, event videos, or statistics)
      from third-party sources such as YouTube, ESPN, or official UFC data providers.
      These services may collect data according to their own privacy policies.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      We use cookies to store preferences and analyze site usage. You can disable cookies
      in your browser settings, though some site features may not function properly.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
    <p>
      We use standard security measures to protect your data, but please note that
      no online system is completely secure.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Links to External Sites</h2>
    <p>
      Our site may link to external websites for additional fighter data, images, or events.
      We are not responsible for the content or privacy practices of those sites.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Updates to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this Privacy Policy occasionally. All changes will be posted on this page
      with the updated effective date.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
      For questions about this Privacy Policy, contact us at:
      <a href="mailto:privacy@fightstats.com">privacy@fightstats.com</a>.
    </p>